WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.448
Bua i waa SaloneHCM kɛlɛi self-service leningohu ma.

2
00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:14.026
Nɛ̀ kpɛlɛ kpɛtɛwɔi yɛ i nya a lɔ ii piɛnga gbɔ kpɛlɛ kpɛlɛ — i payslip-ngɛa tonga, leave kpele, ii kɛlɛi-haa lɔli, àmba ii lɔ-nyahei kpɛtɛ — koni i ti lɔ ba HR office-ɔ ma.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.853
Login-ngɛi kɛ i kɛlɛi email nɛ̀mùhun kɛ̀lɛ nìi password ngìi HR yì ii ma.

4
00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:24.077
Bi i password tii, ii administrator nìingɔ i pɛnda wulo kpindi gbɔ.

5
00:00:24.077 --> 00:00:26.914
Mu login-ngɛ ve bi Joseph, vɔtɛi kɛlɛi gɛɛla.

6
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.169
Self-service ndowɔi ti ii pɛlɛ.

7
00:00:30.169 --> 00:00:37.967
Ii payslip-ngɛa lɛ wɔ ye nga kɛ kpindi kɛ kpindi gbɔ — kpɔtɔng nyapoi, jiama-yɛi, nɛ̀mùhun ndɛ nyapoi kɛ nyandɛ kɛ nyandɛ gbɔ.

8
00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:47.066
Wòtì numu pɛlɛ kɛ i PAYE takisi, ii NASSIT hɔlɔ-yɛi, lò-nyapoi nìi i pi hɛ̀nga hɔma — àmba PDF nyaka kɛ ii lɔ-nyahaa wu, ɔ bi bank lò-kpelei hinga.

9
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:55.135
Kɛngɔ wɛlɛ-wàtii i hɔya? Leave ndowɔi hu, new request-ɔ pɛini, ii ndɛ-ngɛa nɛ̀mùhun leave gbɔtɔi lɛɛ, àmba wuli.

10
00:00:55.135 --> 00:01:01.405
Ii kɛlɛi-mɔhini na-yɛla yɛkpɛɛ, àmba i nya njɛla-jifɛi yaa pɛnde wɔ yini pending-ɔ nya bɛ approved ma.

11
00:01:01.405 --> 00:01:04.786
Ii wɛlɛ-jifɛi nìi ii tii wɔ lɛɛ ngi kpɛlɛ, kɔ̀ yemɔ ti.

12
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:11.336
Attendance ndowɔi ma i clock in nɛ̀mùhun clock out kɛ, àmba ii lɔ-mɔi-yɛi lɔ tɔwa.

13
00:01:11.336 --> 00:01:19.834
Bi lɔ watɛi yaa yɛ kpɛɛla — bi bi hinda clock-out watɛi ti ti-nya haa — ii HR officer gɛlɛ, àmba à nìingɔ kpɛɛlɛ, nìi kpɛɛli-haa yɛ lɔla.

14
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:24.489
Nìi nà — payslip-ngɛa, leave, nɛ̀mùhun attendance, gbɔ a ye ii woma ma.

15
00:01:24.489 --> 00:01:30.818
Bi lɔ watɛi ii gɔlɔi ta, Training Center-ɔ ma kpɛlɛ lɔli-yɛi kpɛtɛ-kati yɛ wɔ kɛlɛi-gɛɛla-ngɛa hinga nɔmɔ.

16
00:01:30.818 --> 00:01:32.490
Tɛnki bi ii tonga-yɛi hinga.
